Package: rtcrapp
Title: Shiny Display Modules for Real-Time Clinical Data Review
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ashok", "Gunuganti", , "agunuganti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generic Shiny display modules driven by form types and study configuration (study.yml displays), presenting results computed by the core package: what changed, visit status, over-time charts, timelines, listings, check results and subject profiles, with review marks and Excel export.
